BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 676.0 Tm (FFS.so and OFS.so are distinct filesystem modules. Treating their data blocks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 659.0 Tm (interchangeably is unsafe, even where they share metadata code and AmigaDOS namespace) Tj ET
