BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 578.0 Tm (and Amiga developer references remain the authorities on actual DOS1/3/5 variants, not the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 561.0 Tm (appearance of a generic PDF diagram.) Tj ET
