BT /F2 13.5 Tf 0.02 0.44 0.50 rg 1 0 0 1 50 710 Tm (VALIDATION, RECOVERY AND COMPATIBILITY) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 678 Tm (1. FFS removes per-data-block OFS checksums, so a damaged data payload may not be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 661.5 Tm (detectable through the metadata checksum chain.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 635 Tm (2. Check root, directory and extension block checksums and confirm that all data-block) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 618.5 Tm (addresses remain inside partition bounds.) Tj ET
